        "CUST-12345",
        "cust-67890"
      ],
      "sensitive": false,
      "aiDescription": "The caller's customer identifier, in the shape CUST-00000. Extract it from the caller's phrase and resolve it against the enumerated set of valid customer identifiers, which canonicalises the casing."
